text = "This forest used to be a busy thriving national park but slowly degraded and became neglected due to a lack of funding by the city. 


In just 30 days unless cleaned up it will lose its protection status and be under threat of getting sold to an AI corporation as land for a datacentre.


After your fathers passing you and your brother decide to save the park that your father loved and become forest rangers there.
"
horizontal_alignment = 1
